				<RadzenIcon Icon="deployed_code" class="fs-1" />
			</div>
			<div class="col-8 fs-1">
				Raycasting is a rendering technique that uses a 2D map to 
				create a 3D perspective used in early video game development. 
				It is essentially an illusion of 3D.
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
